000100*================================================================
000200* RDTRV  TRAVEL RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE TRV.
000400*        USED BY RATTRV01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  TRIP-TYPE       S SINGLE, A ANNUAL MULTI-TRIP, M MULTI-TRIP
000900*  DEST-ZONE       1 UK, 2 EUROPE, 3 WORLDWIDE EX USA, 4 USA
001000*  MAX-TRIP-DAYS   LONGEST TRIP, DAYS
001100*  TRAVELLERS      NUMBER OF TRAVELLERS
001200*  WINTER-SPORTS   Y = WINTER SPORTS COVER
001300*  OLDEST-AGE      AGE OF THE OLDEST TRAVELLER
001400*================================================================
001500 01  WS-TRV-DETAIL.
001600     05  WS-TRIP-TYPE             PIC X(01).
001700     05  WS-DEST-ZONE             PIC 9(01).
001800     05  WS-MAX-TRIP-DAYS         PIC 9(03).
001900     05  WS-TRAVELLERS            PIC 9(02).
002000     05  WS-WINTER-SPORTS         PIC X(01).
002100     05  WS-OLDEST-AGE            PIC 9(02).
002200     05  FILLER                  PIC X(50).
